## What to deliver

Build the node up operation by operation until each `frames/<index>.png` matches
the brief: the same centered capacitor can in every frame, its core dark and
unlit at frame 0 and brightening monotonically to a white-hot critical core with
a glow halo and amber overcharge sparks at frames 3–4, all on full transparency.
Played in order the frames must read as one component charging up. When you are
satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are your finished submission.
